<lb/>des Societés Royales de <rs key="place_GEO-2643743" type="place">Londres</rs>, de
<lb/><rs key="place_GEO-2950159" type="place">Berlin</rs> <choice><orig><g ref="#etlig">&amp;</g></orig><reg>et</reg></choice>c.
<lb/>au <rs type="place">College Royal</rs> à
